        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana 55D2006, Modern Series 24 Inch Double Towel Bar</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe 24 Inch Double Towel Bar has room enough for around 4 bathroom towels. It is easy to install and comes packaged with all the necessary mounting hardware. The Modern Series 24 Inch Double Towel Bar is made out of solid brass and comes in your choice of four popular finish colors. This 24 Inch Modern Double Towel Bar features clean lines for a contemporary look that makes it a great choice for new builds and bathroom upgrades alike.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-55D2006-specifications.gif?v=1704354681\" width=\"600\" height=\"246\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana 55D2006 24\" Double Towel Bar Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available:\r\n<br>\r\n<a href=\"/products/modern-18-inch-towel-bar-deltana-55d2002-18\"><b>18\" 55D Series Towel Bar</b></a>\r\n<br>\r\n<a href=\"/products/modern-24-inch-towel-bar-deltana-55d2003-24\"><b>24\" 55D Series Towel Bar</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nShop more of the <a href=\"/search?type=product&q=Deltana 55D Modern Series\"><b>Deltana 55D Series Bathroom Accessories</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> of the 24 Inch Double Bathroom Towel Bar:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 25-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Bar Length: 22-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Bar Length Including Mount: 23-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Projection: 4-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance from Wall to the Bar: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Space Between the Two Towel Bars: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Mount Height: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Mount Width: 1-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-55D2006-specifications.pdf?v=1691095323\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana 55D2006 24\" Double Towel Bar Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Sold Individually.</b> Package includes: 1 towel bar, mounting screw cover, and all necessary mounting screws.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>This is a Limited Series. <b>Limited Quantities Available</b></i>\r\n</p>",
